#!/bin/sh
# Restart=on-failure translation (see the shared shape in ryoku-idle/finish)
# plus the BindsTo=ryoku-rashin half of ryoku-prowl: when rashin stops for
# any reason, prowl goes down with it.
exec 2>&1
_here=$(dirname "$0")
sv down "$_here/../ryoku-prowl" >/dev/null 2>&1 || true
[ "$1" -eq 0 ] && [ "${2:-0}" -eq 0 ] && exec sv down .
exit 0
